    "%lld sessions with open terminals will be skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将跳过 %lld 个终端已打开的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld tool calls": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 次工具调用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Open tabs** lists every tab with what its CLI is doing. ⌘1 to ⌘9 switch between tabs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**已打开** 列出每个标签页，以及它的 CLI 正在做什么。⌘1 到 ⌘9 可在标签页之间切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Resume** continues in the original CLI and folder. **Branch** tries another approach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**继续** 会在原来的 CLI 和文件夹中接着运行。**分支** 可以换一种思路尝试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Resume** continues this conversation in its CLI, in its original folder. Double-clicking the session in the sidebar does the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**继续** 会在原来的文件夹中用它的 CLI 接着这段对话。在侧栏双击这个会话也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 message": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 条消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 session with an open terminal will be skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将跳过 1 个终端已打开的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 tool call": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 次工具调用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A CLI still running in tmux reattaches. Any other tab, such as after a restart of your Mac, resumes its session when you select it. Plain terminals open a new shell in their folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍在 tmux 中运行的 CLI 会重新连接。其他标签会在选中时继续会话，包括 Mac 重启后的会话。普通终端会在原文件夹中打开新 shell。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
