    "Choose **Add SSH host…** in the sidebar. The host needs passwordless SSH, rsync, and the CLI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在侧边栏选择 **添加 SSH 主机…**。主机需要免密码 SSH、rsync 和对应的 CLI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a session in the sidebar to read its conversation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在侧栏中选择一个会话，阅读其对话内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose or enter a folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择或输入文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code, Antigravity, and Pi sessions move to the Trash; Codex, Kiro CLI, and OpenCode sessions are permanently deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code、Antigravity 和 Pi 会话将移到废纸篓；Codex、Kiro CLI 和 OpenCode 会话将被永久删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code, Antigravity, and Pi sessions on this Mac move to the Trash. Codex, Kiro CLI, and OpenCode sessions and all sessions on SSH hosts are permanently deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机的 Claude Code、Antigravity 和 Pi 会话将移到废纸篓。Codex、Kiro CLI、OpenCode 会话和 SSH 主机上的所有会话将被永久删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity, Kiro CLI, OpenCode, and Pi sessions on the host are listed under it in the sidebar, and open over SSH. Use a Host alias from ~/.ssh/config or user@hostname. `ssh <host>` must work without a password prompt, and the host needs rsync. Antigravity and OpenCode also need python3; deleting Antigravity sessions needs lsof. Install tmux on the remote host so sessions keep running when the connection drops or the tab closes; click the session to reattach. The app's bundled tmux is only for this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机上的 Claude Code、Codex、Antigravity、Kiro CLI、OpenCode 和 Pi 会话会列在侧栏中，并通过 SSH 打开。请使用 ~/.ssh/config 中的主机别名或 user@hostname。`ssh <host>` 必须能够免密连接，主机还需要 rsync。Antigravity 和 OpenCode 还需要 python3；删除 Antigravity 会话还需要 lsof。在远程主机上安装 tmux，可让会话在断线或关闭标签后继续运行；点击会话即可重新连接。应用内置的 tmux 仅适用于此 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear filters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清除筛选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a session to read it. Nothing runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击会话即可阅读，不会启动任何 CLI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a session to read it; nothing runs. Double-click it to continue in its CLI, in the original folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单击会话即可阅读，不会运行任何东西。双击则在原文件夹中用它的 CLI 继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the project's name to collapse its tabs. A collapsed group still shows when a CLI is waiting on you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
