    "JustSessions and the CLIs in its terminals need it to reach a device on your network, such as an SSH host at a local address. macOS doesn't let apps check it, so look for JustSessions in Privacy & Security > Local Network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JustSessions 及其终端中的 CLI 需要它来访问你所在网络中的设备，例如本地地址上的 SSH 主机。macOS 不允许应用检查这项权限，请在「隐私与安全性 > 本地网络」中找到 JustSessions。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JustSessions read the history your CLIs keep and grouped it by project. Nothing was imported or uploaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JustSessions 读取了各 CLI 自己保存的历史，并按项目分组。没有导入或上传任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JustSessions website ↗": {
      "localizations": {
