          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭这个标签页时选择 **保持运行**：CLI 会继续运行，退出 App 后也不会停。单击它的会话即可回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works for Claude Code and Codex on this Mac, also while they run in tmux with no tab open. A session whose tab you are looking at sends none. Click a notification to open the session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持本机的 Claude Code 和 Codex，也支持在 tmux 中运行但未打开标签的会话。正在查看的会话不会发送通知。点击通知即可打开会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
